      "content": "That's a helpful distinction. One thing I'm worried about is the client's perception of volatility and \"noise\" in the market. Sometimes things just seem to go wrong for no apparent reason—like unexpected gaps in pricing or sudden spikes in costs. Is there a technical way to describe those kinds of unpredictable disruptions or inefficiencies that might crop up in these fund types?",
